Package: combatrefql
Title: Reference-Batch Adjustment of Bulk RNA-Seq Counts
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Xiaoyu",
      "Zhang",
      role = "ctb",
      comment = "ComBat-ref method and original implementation"
    ),
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "thomasirchi@gmail.com")
  )
Description: ComBat-refQL adjusts raw bulk RNA-seq count matrices toward an
    observed reference batch while modelling biological groups and covariates
    whose fitted effects should be preserved. It uses quasi-likelihood
    modelling, empirical-Bayes moderation, hierarchical dispersion modelling,
    and deterministic count transport to return integer adjusted counts with
    diagnostic and correction-confidence summaries for downstream expression-
    space analyses.
